// NOT the Wilderness. The main rectangle above is the client's own (x 2944-3391, z 3520-6399), and
// everything from z 3968 up in it is underground space that was never Wilderness in RuneScape -
// it only counts as "level 180-odd" because the rectangle runs on past the surface. A place listed
// here is level 0 whatever the rectangles say, so a pocket can be cleared without moving the
// Wilderness's own borders (the Abyss, which the 2006 content treats as PvP, stays as it was).
[wilderness_excluded_zones]
table=coord_pair_table
// Everything underground in the main rectangle, from map row 63 (z 4032) up, except the Abyss
// (m47_75): Tolna's rift (A Soul's Bane, m46-48_81), the Agility Pyramid's top (m47_73), the drill
// demon's parade ground (m49_75), Rogues' Den (m46-47_77-78), the Recipe for Disaster caves
// (m46-47_79, m47_85) and whatever else is ever put up there. Four rectangles round the Abyss.
data=coord_pair,0_46_63_0_0,3_52_74_63_63
data=coord_pair,0_46_75_0_0,3_46_75_63_63
data=coord_pair,0_48_75_0_0,3_52_75_63_63
